        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>In your games, do you allow flying combatants to be safe from grounded opponents (excepting, of course, attacks expliciting defined as ranged attacks like blasts or thrown cars)?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To put it another way, can your close combat fighters still punch your flyers? If so, do you at least make them describe how they do it?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Or do you just say, \"Flight has no inherent defensive benefit unless an Ability says so?\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
