      {
        "id": 231116,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-15T00:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For my portal generator, he has a saying:&nbsp;\"I learned the hard way that some folks can fly. Doesn't make them any better at dodging falling cars, though.\" ;-)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It's on the players to come up with a way to deal with situations like that. If I'm running the game, I'm not granting any specific immunities, but I'm also expecting the players to come up with something narratively that will address the situation.&nbsp;</p>",
